- **`model`** (string, required) — The model to use for classification.
- **`input`** (ChatClassificationRequestInputs, required) — The chat to classify, structured as one of the following:
  - **`messages`** (array of objects, required) — When using the `InstructRequest` format, this must be an array of message objects.

The `input` field itself can be either:
- An object of type `InstructRequest` containing the `messages` array, **or**
- An array of `InstructRequest` objects.

### Example Structure
```
{
  "model": "string",
  "input": {
    "messages": [
      {
        "role": "string",
        "content": "string"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

or

```
{
  "model": "string",
  "input": [
    {
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "string",
          "content": "string"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

