```json
{
  "model": "your-model-name",
  "input": {
    "messages": [
      {"role": "user", "content": "Your chat content here"}
    ]
  }
}
```

The `input` field can also be an **array of `InstructRequest` objects** (e.g., multiple chats in an array).

