  "answer_markdown": "When the **included monthly usage on your Vibe Pro plan runs out without pay-as-you-go enabled**, Vibe is **disabled for your team until the next billing period** [1]. This means no API requests will work until the next month's budget resets. If pay-as-you-go is **enabled** (toggle on in the Admin Panel), Vibe continues to function, and additional usage is billed on a pay-as-you-go basis [1]. However, this toggle is **off by default** and **cannot be enabled on Vibe Pro plans purchased through partners** (e.g., Google, Apple, Free Mobile, Orange) [1], meaning those plans will disable Vibe entirely once the budget is exhausted [1]."

  }

