].\n\nFor **Vibe Code** (CLI, VS Code, or Web), the process is similar but focused on code-related tasks (e.g., refactoring, explaining files, or preparing PRs) [5]. You still retain control, with Vibe showing progress and seeking approval for critical actions.\n\n**Note**: If you prefer a turn-based conversation (e.g., for quick questions or legacy features like Agents or Code Interpreter), use **Vibe Chat** instead [3].",
