  "answer_markdown": "When the **included monthly usage on your Vibe Pro plan runs out without pay-as-you-go enabled**, the behavior depends on the subscription type and the toggle setting in the Admin Panel under [Subscriptions › Vibe subscription](https://admin.mistral.ai/subscriptions) [1]. By default, this toggle is **off**, meaning Vibe is **disabled for the entire Organization** until the next billing period begins [1]. If the toggle is **enabled**, Vibe continues to work, and additional usage is billed pay-as-you-go. However, this toggle **cannot be enabled on Vibe Pro plans purchased through partners** (e.g., Google, Apple, Free Mobile, Orange), so Vibe is always disabled once the included budget is exhausted on those plans [1]."

                    }

