      "n": 1,
      "quote": "Vibe Code can stop until the next billing period. Pay-as-you-go is off by default. Some Pro plans purchased through partners (Google, Apple, Free Mobile, Orange) cannot enable pay-as-you-go. On those plans, Vibe Code stops once included monthly usage is exhausted."
    },
